@startuml TemplateGeneration
title Create, check, and reuse a template
autonumber
actor User
participant Application as App
participant Domain
participant Model
participant MCP

User -> App: Prompt and easy/medium/hard difficulty
App -> Domain: Get instructions and schema
App -> MCP: Get tools tagged for this domain once
App -> Model: Request proposal and check plan with arguments
Model --> App: Proposal, names and model-owned arguments
App -> App: Validate and freeze plan

loop Until success, initial proposal plus at most 3 revisions
    App -> Domain: Build candidate under original request
    loop Selected technical checks
        App -> MCP: Call with frozen arguments and current candidate
        MCP -> MCP: Run checking operation
        MCP --> App: Evidence or explicit error
    end
    opt Selected difficulty check and technical prerequisites passed
        App -> Domain: Bind checked template and distractors
        App -> MCP: Assess template difficulty
        MCP --> App: Judge evidence or error
    end
    alt All selected checks passed
        App -> Domain: Package recipes and sampled checking statistics
        Domain --> App: Artifact, or missing required data
        App -> App: checked, or needs_review if data is missing
    else Failed and revisions remain and no terminal judge error
        App -> Model: Original request, latest candidate, plan, evidence and budget
        Model --> App: Complete replacement proposal
        App -> App: Validate full response; retain original plan
    else Final failure or terminal judge error
        App -> App: needs_review with history and skipped checks
    end
end
App --> User: One report with all attempts; small artifact if available

note over App, User
Saved artifacts get a new ID.
Reports keep history; artifacts keep content, recipes and checking statistics.
Existing-candidate validation checks once without revisions.
Interrupted generation returns error.
No native tool-request or acknowledgement calls are needed.
Every replacement is checked afresh; skipped checks stay explicit.
Human approval is future product work.
end note

User -> App: Saved artifact and seed
App -> Domain: Generate question locally
Domain --> App: Draft question requiring manual review
App --> User: Draft question; no model or MCP calls
@enduml
